---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-tragos" set:html={`
<section class="hero"><div class="heroin"><div><div class="crumb">Eventos / Tragos</div><div class="eyebrow">Barra y compras</div><h1>Calculá la barra en botellas, hielo y mezcladores</h1><p class="lead">Elegí el tipo de fiesta, cuántos toman y cuánto dura. Te damos una lista para comprar con margen, no litros imposibles de llevar.</p><div class="pills"><span>Botellas enteras</span><span>Consumo por hora</span><span>Opciones sin alcohol</span></div></div><div class="scene" aria-label="Trago con hielo y lima"><div class="bar"></div><div class="glass"><div class="straw"></div><div class="cup"><div class="drink"></div><i class="ice i1"></i><i class="ice i2"></i><div class="lime"></div></div><div class="stem"></div><div class="base"></div></div><div class="tag"><small>Para tu barra</small><strong id="heroDrinks">360 tragos</strong></div></div></div></section>
<section class="tool"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="kicker">Elegí qué vas a servir</div><h2>Una barra simple compra mejor</h2></div><p>Cuantas más recetas ofrecés, más botellas abiertas y sobrantes aparecen.</p></div><div class="cases"><button class="case active" data-case="simple"><strong>Barra simple</strong><small>Fernet, gin y aperitivo.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="full"><strong>Barra completa</strong><small>Destilados y variedad amplia.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="cocktails"><strong>Dos tragos de autor</strong><small>Recetas cerradas y mise en place.</small></button><button class="case" data-case="zero"><strong>Barra sin alcohol</strong><small>Mocktails, gaseosas y aguas.</small></button></div>
<div class="workspace"><div class="panel form"><h3>Datos de la fiesta</h3><p class="sub" id="caseCopy">Una selección corta permite comprar mejor y servir más rápido.</p><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label for="guests">Invitados adultos</label><input id="guests" type="number" min="1" max="1000" value="100"></div><div class="field"><label for="drinkers">Porcentaje que toma alcohol</label><select id="drinkers"><option value=".5">50%</option><option value=".7" selected>70%</option><option value=".85">85%</option><option value="1">100%</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="hours">Duración de la barra</label><input id="hours" type="number" min="1" max="15" value="5"></div><div class="field"><label for="pace">Ritmo de consumo</label><select id="pace"><option value=".55">Tranquilo · 0,55/h</option><option value=".8" selected>Medio · 0,8/h</option><option value="1">Alto · 1/h</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="spirit">Medida de destilado</label><select id="spirit"><option value="45">45 ml</option><option value="50" selected>50 ml</option><option value="60">60 ml</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="margin">Margen de compra</label><select id="margin"><option value="1">Sin margen</option><option value="1.1" selected>10%</option><option value="1.15">15%</option><option value="1.2">20%</option></select></div></div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="calculate">Armar lista de compras</button><button class="reset" id="reset">Reiniciar</button></div></div>
<aside class="panel result" aria-live="polite"><span class="badge" id="badge">Barra simple</span><div class="big" id="drinks">308 tragos</div><div class="biglabel" id="drinkLabel">con alcohol, margen incluido</div><div class="meters"><div class="meter"><small>Destilado</small><strong id="bottles">22 botellas</strong></div><div class="meter"><small>Mezcladores</small><strong id="mixers">46 L</strong></div><div class="meter"><small>Hielo</small><strong id="ice">62 kg</strong></div><div class="meter"><small>Sin alcohol</small><strong id="soft">50 L</strong></div></div><div class="shopping"><div class="row"><span id="row1Label">Fernet o aperitivo</span><strong id="row1">9 botellas</strong></div><div class="row"><span id="row2Label">Gin o vodka</span><strong id="row2">9 botellas</strong></div><div class="row"><span id="row3Label">Reserva y variedad</span><strong id="row3">4 botellas</strong></div><div class="row"><span>Cítricos y garnish</span><strong id="garnish">16 kg</strong></div></div><div class="tip" id="tip">Enfriá bebidas antes del evento: usar hielo para bajar temperatura duplica el consumo de bolsas.</div></aside></div></div></section>
<section class="guide"><div class="wrap guide-grid"><div><div class="kicker">Para que la barra fluya</div><h2>La logística importa tanto como la cantidad</h2><p>Botellas frías, hielo separado y recetas simples reducen espera, desperdicio y errores.</p></div><div class="checks"><div class="check"><b>Agua siempre visible</b><span>Calculá al menos medio litro por invitado y reponé durante toda la fiesta.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Hielo en dos usos</b><span>Separá el hielo limpio para vasos del hielo destinado a enfriar botellas.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Medida estándar</b><span>Usar jigger mantiene sabor, rendimiento y graduación consistentes.</span></div><div class="check"><b>Alternativas cero alcohol</b><span>No las trates como un extra: deben tener la misma presencia y calidad que el resto.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="faq"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">Preguntas frecuentes</div><h2>Antes de comprar las botellas</h2><div class="faq-item open"><button class="faq-q">¿Cuántos tragos salen de una botella?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">De una botella de 750 ml salen 15 tragos de 50 ml, antes de considerar derrames o medidas generosas.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿Cuánto hielo necesito?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Como punto de partida, unos 200 g por trago si también se usa para enfriar y mantener la barra operativa.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">¿Conviene ofrecer muchos tragos?<span>+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Una carta corta suele funcionar mejor: acelera el servicio, simplifica compras y evita botellas abiertas que no se usan.</div></div></div></section>`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-tragos')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-tragos');

(()=>{const $=s=>root.querySelector(s),$$=s=>[...root.querySelectorAll(s)],fmt=n=>Math.ceil(n).toLocaleString("es-AR");let active="simple";const presets={simple:[100,.7,5,.8,50,1.1,"Una selección corta permite comprar mejor y servir más rápido."],full:[120,.8,6,.85,50,1.15,"La variedad aumenta botellas abiertas: reservamos más margen."],cocktails:[80,.75,5,.75,50,1.1,"Dos recetas cerradas facilitan preparar jarabes, jugos y garnish."],zero:[100,0,5,.8,0,1.1,"La barra se concentra en mocktails, gaseosas, aguas y hielo."]};function calculate(){const guests=+$("#guests").value,drinkers=+$("#drinkers").value,hours=+$("#hours").value,pace=+$("#pace").value,measure=+$("#spirit").value,margin=+$("#margin").value,alcGuests=guests*drinkers,drinks=Math.ceil(alcGuests*hours*pace*margin),bottles=measure?Math.ceil(drinks*measure/750):0,mixers=drinks*.15,ice=Math.ceil((drinks+guests)*.16),soft=Math.ceil(guests*(1-drinkers)*hours*.35+guests*.5),garnish=Math.ceil(drinks*.05);$("#drinks").textContent=(active==="zero"?Math.ceil(guests*hours*.65*margin):drinks)+" tragos";$("#heroDrinks").textContent=$("#drinks").textContent;$("#drinkLabel").textContent=active==="zero"?"sin alcohol, margen incluido":"con alcohol, margen incluido";$("#bottles").textContent=bottles+" botellas";$("#mixers").textContent=fmt(active==="zero"?guests*hours*.25:mixers)+" L";$("#ice").textContent=ice+" kg";$("#soft").textContent=soft+" L";const shares=active==="full"?[.3,.3,.4]:active==="cocktails"?[.5,.5,0]:[.4,.4,.2];$("#row1Label").textContent=active==="cocktails"?"Base del trago 1":active==="zero"?"Jugos y pulpas":"Fernet o aperitivo";$("#row2Label").textContent=active==="cocktails"?"Base del trago 2":active==="zero"?"Tónicas y sodas":"Gin o vodka";$("#row3Label").textContent=active==="zero"?"Jarabes y frutas":"Reserva y variedad";$("#row1").textContent=active==="zero"?fmt(guests*.18)+" L":Math.ceil(bottles*shares[0])+" botellas";$("#row2").textContent=active==="zero"?fmt(guests*.22)+" L":Math.ceil(bottles*shares[1])+" botellas";$("#row3").textContent=active==="zero"?fmt(guests*.08)+" L":Math.ceil(bottles*shares[2])+" botellas";$("#garnish").textContent=garnish+" kg"}
$$("[data-case]").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{active=b.dataset.case;const p=presets[active];["guests","drinkers","hours","pace","spirit","margin"].forEach((id,i)=>$("#"+id).value=p[i]<1&&p[i]>0?String(p[i]).replace(/^0/,""):String(p[i]));$("#caseCopy").textContent=p[6];$("#badge").textContent=b.querySelector("strong").textContent;$$("[data-case]").forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle("active",x===b));calculate()}));$$("input,select").forEach(x=>x.addEventListener("input",calculate));$("#calculate").addEventListener("click",calculate);$("#reset").addEventListener("click",()=>$("[data-case=simple]").click());$$(".faq-q").forEach(q=>q.addEventListener("click",()=>q.parentElement.classList.toggle("open")));calculate()})();

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-tragos{--blue:#174b7a;--blue2:#397f9f;--ink:#182334;--muted:#626d7b;--line:#dce3e4;--cream:#fff8e8;--coral:#d76855;--lime:#b9d871;--aqua:#dff2ef;--gold:#e3b34f}.mockup-tragos *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-tragos{margin:0;font:16px/1.45 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fcfdfb}.mockup-tragos button,.mockup-tragos input,.mockup-tragos select{font:inherit}.mockup-tragos .head{height:74px;padding:0 max(24px,calc((100% - 1180px)/2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:white;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-tragos .brand{font-size:19px;font-weight:900}.mockup-tragos .brand b{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;margin-right:10px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--blue);color:white}.mockup-tragos .nav{display:flex;gap:28px;color:#4e5967;font-size:14px;font-weight:750}.mockup-tragos .search{padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;background:white}.mockup-tragos .hero{padding:55px 24px 62px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#fcfdf9 0 64%,#e5f3ef 64%)}.mockup-tragos .heroin{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:55px;align-items:center}.mockup-tragos .crumb{font-size:14px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:850}.mockup-tragos .eyebrow{margin-top:27px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--coral);font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-tragos .hero h1{font-size:clamp(43px,5vw,68px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:10px 0 20px;max-width:700px}.mockup-tragos .lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);max-width:650px}.mockup-tragos .pills{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px}.mockup-tragos .pills span{padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:white;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.mockup-tragos .scene{min-height:340px;position:relative}.mockup-tragos .bar{position:absolute;left:2%;right:2%;bottom:28px;height:80px;background:#b67e53;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 22px 32px #60432625}.mockup-tragos .glass{position:absolute;left:50%;top:23px;width:190px;height:260px;transform:translateX(-50%)}.mockup-tragos .cup{position:absolute;left:15px;right:15px;top:0;height:185px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffffaa,#dff5f6aa);border:8px solid var(--blue);border-radius:14px 14px 85px 85px;overflow:hidden}.mockup-tragos .drink{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:72%;background:linear-gradient(#f5b35a,#dc6655)}.mockup-tragos .ice{position:absolute;width:45px;height:40px;border:4px solid white;background:#d9f2f3bb;transform:rotate(17deg)}.mockup-tragos .i1{left:20px;top:30px}.mockup-tragos .i2{right:22px;top:50px}.mockup-tragos .lime{position:absolute;right:-18px;top:30px;width:78px;height:78px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(#a6ca54 0 12%,#eaf4c6 12% 24%,#a6ca54 24% 36%,#eaf4c6 36% 48%,#a6ca54 48% 60%,#eaf4c6 60% 72%,#a6ca54 72% 84%,#eaf4c6 84%);border:7px solid #7ba53d}.mockup-tragos .stem{position:absolute;left:89px;top:185px;width:12px;height:54px;background:var(--blue)}.mockup-tragos .base{position:absolute;left:48px;bottom:0;width:94px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--blue)}.mockup-tragos .straw{position:absolute;left:58px;top:-25px;width:8px;height:185px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(#fff 0 13px,var(--coral) 13px 26px);transform:rotate(-10deg)}.mockup-tragos .tag{position:absolute;right:0;top:33px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:13px;box-shadow:0 12px 25px #24433718}.mockup-tragos .tag small{display:block;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-tragos .tag strong{font-size:21px;color:var(--coral)}
.mockup-tragos .tool{padding:65px 24px}.mockup-tragos .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto}.mockup-tragos .sectionhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:30px;margin-bottom:23px}.mockup-tragos .kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--coral);font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-tragos .sectionhead h2,.mockup-tragos .guide h2,.mockup-tragos .faq h2{font-size:37px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0}.mockup-tragos .sectionhead p{max-width:510px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.mockup-tragos .cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:22px}.mockup-tragos .case{min-height:106px;padding:17px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;background:white;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}.mockup-tragos .case strong{display:block;margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-tragos .case small{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-tragos .case.active{border:2px solid var(--coral);padding:16px;background:#fff7f4;box-shadow:0 9px 22px #a34b3c12}.mockup-tragos .workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:20px}.mockup-tragos .panel{padding:28px;border-radius:24px}.mockup-tragos .form{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 16px 40px #17364a0d}.mockup-tragos .panel h3{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 5px}.mockup-tragos .sub{margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.mockup-tragos .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.mockup-tragos .field.full{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-tragos .field label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;margin-bottom:7px}.mockup-tragos .field small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:6px}.mockup-tragos input,.mockup-tragos select{width:100%;min-height:50px;border:1px solid #d3dcdd;border-radius:12px;background:white;padding:12px 14px;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-tragos .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}.mockup-tragos .primary{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--blue);color:white;padding:14px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.mockup-tragos .reset{border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:12px;background:white;color:#6b5120;padding:13px 17px;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-tragos .result{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--blue),var(--blue2));color:white}.mockup-tragos .result:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:250px;height:250px;border:46px solid #ffffff0b;border-radius:50%;right:-130px;bottom:-120px}.mockup-tragos .badge{display:inline-block;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#e6f3d1;color:#415b17;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.mockup-tragos .big{font-size:49px;line-height:1;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:14px 0 3px}.mockup-tragos .biglabel{color:#dfedf2;font-size:14px}.mockup-tragos .meters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:9px;margin:20px 0}.mockup-tragos .meter{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:13px 10px;border:1px solid #ffffff2c;background:#ffffff0e;border-radius:14px}.mockup-tragos .meter small{display:block;color:#dcebf1;font-size:11px}.mockup-tragos .meter strong{font-size:17px}.mockup-tragos .shopping{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:15px;border:1px solid #ffffff28;background:#ffffff0f;border-radius:15px}.mockup-tragos .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;padding:7px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff20}.mockup-tragos .row:last-child{border:0}.mockup-tragos .row span{color:#dcebf1}.mockup-tragos .tip{position:relative;z-index:1;margin-top:15px;padding:13px 15px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--cream);color:#58482d;font-size:13px;font-weight:750}.mockup-tragos .guide{padding:70px 24px;background:#f3f7f5}.mockup-tragos .guide-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;gap:44px}.mockup-tragos .guide p{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-tragos .checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.mockup-tragos .check{padding:18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:white}.mockup-tragos .check b{display:block;color:#26715c;margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-tragos .check span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-tragos .faq{padding:70px 24px}.mockup-tragos .faq-item{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-tragos .faq-q{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 0;border:0;background:none;text-align:left;color:var(--ink);font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.mockup-tragos .faq-a{display:none;padding:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted);max-width:820px}.mockup-tragos .faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}.mockup-tragos .foot{padding:30px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:white;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:870px){.mockup-tragos .nav{display:none}.mockup-tragos .heroin,.mockup-tragos .workspace,.mockup-tragos .guide-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-tragos .cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mockup-tragos .sectionhead{flex-direction:column;align-items:start}}@media(max-width:540px){.mockup-tragos .cases,.mockup-tragos .fields,.mockup-tragos .checks,.mockup-tragos .meters{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-tragos .hero h1{font-size:44px}.mockup-tragos .actions{flex-direction:column}}

.mockup-tragos { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
.mockup-tragos .top, .mockup-tragos header.top { display:none !important; }
.mockup-tragos .foot { display:none !important; }
.mockup-tragos .support-real { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px)); margin:auto; padding:64px 0; }
.mockup-tragos .support-real-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:30px; }
.mockup-tragos .support-real details { border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed; padding:14px 0; }
.mockup-tragos .support-real summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
.mockup-tragos .support-real p { color:#52657b; line-height:1.65; }
/* Prevent the legacy site's global typography palette from overriding text
   designed to inherit a light color inside dark mockup surfaces. */
.mockup-tragos :where(h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,p,span,strong,b,small,em,i,a,label,button,summary,li,th,td) { color:inherit; }
.mockup-tragos input[type="number"] { -moz-appearance:textfield; appearance:textfield; }
.mockup-tragos input[type="number"]::-webkit-inner-spin-button, .mockup-tragos input[type="number"]::-webkit-outer-spin-button { -webkit-appearance:none; margin:0; }
@media(max-width:800px){.mockup-tragos .support-real-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
{data && <section class="mockup-tragos support-real"><div class="support-real-grid"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><div><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}</a>)}</div></div></section>}
